### 📊 Why This Happened

| Your Code Expects | What LangChain 1.3.4 Has |
|:---|:---|
| `langchain.chains.llm` | ❌ Removed completely |
| `LLMChain` class | ❌ Deprecated and removed |
| `langchain.prompts` | ⚠️ Moved to `langchain_core.prompts` |
| Old agent syntax | ✅ Still works with `create_openai_tools_agent` |

The modern LangChain is more modular and powerful, but requires rewriting chains to use the `|` operator.

